Let's learn eight new words. Listen, then it's your turn to say it!

5
00:00:20.441 --> 00:00:22.055
Giggle!

6
00:00:22.105 --> 00:00:26.913
Giggle. Your turn!

7
00:00:26.963 --> 00:00:27.944
Giggle!

8
00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:29.144
Great!

9
00:00:30.173 --> 00:00:31.777
Yawn!

10
00:00:31.827 --> 00:00:36.937
Yawn. Your turn!

11
00:00:36.987 --> 00:00:38.084
Yawn!

12
00:00:38.134 --> 00:00:39.284
Super!

13
00:00:40.299 --> 00:00:42.170
Sneeze!

14
00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:47.528
Sneeze. Your turn!

15
00:00:47.578 --> 00:00:49.069
Sneeze!

16
