17
00:00:51.656 --> 00:00:53.295
Frown!

18
00:00:53.345 --> 00:00:58.629
Frown. Your turn!

19
00:00:58.679 --> 00:00:59.776
Frown!

20
00:00:59.826 --> 00:01:00.976
Yes!

21
00:01:01.980 --> 00:01:03.596
Grin!

22
00:01:03.646 --> 00:01:08.628
