25
00:01:11.897 --> 00:01:13.396
Pout!

26
00:01:13.446 --> 00:01:18.429
Pout. Your turn!

27
00:01:18.479 --> 00:01:19.854
Pout!

28
00:01:19.904 --> 00:01:21.314
Wonderful!

29
00:01:22.116 --> 00:01:23.766
Blink!

30
00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:28.811
