37
00:01:42.305 --> 00:01:51.532
Giggle, Giggle, Giggle! Yawn, Yawn, Yawn! Sneeze, Sneeze, Sneeze! Frown, Frown, Frown!

38
00:01:51.582 --> 00:02:00.577
Grin, Grin, Grin! Pout, Pout, Pout! Blink, Blink, Blink! Hiccup, Hiccup, Hiccup!

39
00:02:00.627 --> 00:02:03.755
Clap, clap! Great chanting!

40
00:02:04.438 --> 00:02:14.774
Let's make silly faces! Can you grin? Can you frown? Ah-choo, I sneeze! Hic, I hiccup! We giggle and giggle.

41
00:02:14.824 --> 00:02:17.686
I love this story, Ms. Lily!

42
00:02:18.731 --> 00:02:24.097
What is it? Can you say it?

43
00:02:24.147 --> 00:02:26.291
Grin! Well done!

44
00:02:27.494 --> 00:02:32.709
What is it? Can you say it?

45
00:02:32.759 --> 00:02:34.931
Blink! Well done!

46
00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:41.612
What is it? Can you say it?

47
00:02:41.662 --> 00:02:43.950
Giggle! Well done!

48
00:02:45.122 --> 00:02:46.915
Let's say it together!

49
00:02:46.965 --> 00:02:53.557
Can you yawn? Yes, I can! Can you blink? Yes, I can!

50
00:02:53.607 --> 00:02:58.299
Your turn!

51
00:02:58.349 --> 00:03:04.516
Can you yawn? Yes, I can! Can you blink? Yes, I can!

52
00:03:05.789 --> 00:03:10.710
Can you make a silly face?

53
00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:17.247
Can you yawn? Yes, I can! Can you blink? Yes, I can!.

54
00:03:17.297 --> 00:03:18.667
Great answer!

55
00:03:19.753 --> 00:03:24.318
Today's value is laughter. Laughing together makes us happy.

56
